      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Radionuclide imaging in a patient who had acute renal failure with severe loin pain and patchy renal vasoconstriction is described. The patient was studied 3h after the intravenous bolus injection of 25 mCi99mTc-methylene diphosphonate (99mTc-MDP). An intense patchy renal concentration of 99mTc-MDP was observed."},
